      "slow flight through a nebula"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "c": [
    {
     "at": null,
     "text": "Belgium's Father Georges Lemaître was a Catholic priest, and also a physicist"
    },
    {
     "at": "उन्नीस सौ सत्ताईस में",
     "text": "In 1927, he used Einstein's equations to show that the universe is not standing still"
    },
    {
     "at": "वह फैल रहा है",
     "text": "It is expanding"
    },
    {
     "at": "उसी साल Brussels में",
     "text": "That same year in Brussels, Einstein told Lemaître..."
    },
    {
     "at": "आपके calculations",
     "text": "\"Your calculations are correct, but your physics is abominable\""
    },
    {
     "at": "दो साल बाद",
     "text": "Two years later, in 1929, America's Edwin Hubble saw distant galaxies racing away from us"
    },
    {
     "at": "और जो जितनी",
     "text": "And the farther they are, the faster they go"
    },
    {
     "at": "उन्नीस सौ इकतीस में",
     "text": "In 1931, Lemaître took the next step"
    },
    {
     "at": "अगर सब कुछ आज",
     "text": "If everything is expanding today, then once, everything must have been together in one place"
    },
    {
     "at": "उन्होंने उसे नाम",
     "text": "He called it the primeval atom: the cosmic egg"
    },
    {
     "at": "इस idea को",
     "text": "The idea needed a name..."
    },
    {
     "at": "और वह नाम दिया",
     "text": "...and the name came from its biggest critic"
    }
   ],
   "sfx": [],
   "n": [
